# DevTrust AI — API Tests
# Requires VS Code REST Client extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# ── Change these two variables to test different profiles ──
@username = Daorss
@jobDescription = Junior Full Stack Developer with experience in building web applications using JavaScript, React.js, Node.js, MySQL, and MongoDB. Skilled in developing responsive user interfaces, backend APIs, database-driven features, and basic CRUD functionality. Has worked on projects such as aviation management and video sharing systems, showing practical experience with full-stack development. Comfortable using GitHub, connecting frontend and backend systems, debugging issues, and improving application functionality.


### Trust score only (no job description)
GET {{baseUrl}}/analyze?githubUsername={{username}}
Accept: text/event-stream

###

### Trust score + job fit analysis
GET {{baseUrl}}/analyze?githubUsername={{username}}&jobDescription={{jobDescription}}
Accept: text/event-stream

###

### Error case — non-existent user
GET {{baseUrl}}/analyze?githubUsername=this-user-does-not-exist-xyz123
Accept: text/event-stream
